# Form submissions are emailed through Brevo. query@adjudixADR.com is the
# main mailbox: every form is delivered there and sent from it. Copy this
# file to .env.local (and set the same variables in Vercel, on every project
# that serves the site) to enable sending.
#
# Brevo > SMTP & API > API keys > Generate a new API key.
BREVO_API_KEY=
# The "from" address. It must be a verified sender in Brevo
# (Brevo > Senders, Domains & Dedicated IPs > Senders).
# MAIL_FROM=query@adjudixADR.com
# The main mailbox: every form (contact, applications, filings) lands here.
# QUERY_MAIL_TO=query@adjudixADR.com
# Optional: send case filings to a separate mailbox instead.
# MAIL_TO=secretariat@adjudixADR.com
